  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "The sides of a right triangle are \\(a,\\) \\(a+d,\\) and \\(a+2d,\\) with \\(a\\) and \\(d\\) both positive. The ratio of \\(a\\) to \\(d\\) is:",
